Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Label the Move dialog root option "Home" to match the
 breadcrumb

The Move Document dialog called the workspace root "(workspace root)"
while the folder breadcrumb labels the same location "Home". Rename the
dialog placeholder and select item to "Home" for consistent naming.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
